WEBVTT

00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:05.188
Team Performance shows how each person’s deals are going, in one table.

00:00:05.188 --> 00:00:06.428
Next to the wins:

00:00:06.748 --> 00:00:12.834
late deals, escalations, deals with no next step, and deals pushed to a later month.

00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:16.620
Sort by Past due to see where the late deals sit.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.640
These numbers describe the work.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.695
They’re not for pay or employment decisions.

00:00:21.695 --> 00:00:25.898
Open a person. Needs attention lists the deals to talk about.

00:00:25.898 --> 00:00:28.478
Open in Pipeline Schedule shows each one,

00:00:28.478 --> 00:00:31.258
and that person stays picked on every dashboard.

00:00:31.976 --> 00:00:33.496
Every one-on-one starts with real deals.

00:00:33.496 --> 00:00:39.316
Become a design partner at revenue.opsgs.com.
